/E (The rapid growth of online betting made gambling markets increasingly difficult to ignore. In 2005, FIFA established the Early Warning System GmbH \(EWS\) in Zurich, an independent, non-commercial organization designed to detect suspicious betting activity. EWS worked with more than 400 bookmakers and betting providers, which supplied information about unusual betting patterns. During this period, FIFA interacted with betting companies primarily as partners in monitoring and fraud prevention, rather than as commercial sponsors.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
