/E (Because many prediction platforms utilize cryptocurrency, pseudonymous accounts, and off-shore hosting, tracking money trails becomes vastly more complex than watching licensed domestic sportsbooks. Researchers highlight risks like wash-trading, rapid money laundering through digital wallets, and regulatory gray zones where platforms operate outside traditional gambling oversight.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
