/E (To fuel the global betting industry, FIFA monetizes its most valuable operational asset: official match data. Fast, low-latency data feeds are essential for sportsbooks to offer live odds adjustments during a game.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
442 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
