/P 176 0 R
/E (FIFA licenses its real-time tracking feeds to major sports data companies \(like Stats Perform\). In exchange for multi-million dollar rights fees, these companies distribute official, millisecond-accurate match stats directly to thousands of sportsbooks worldwide. This data infrastructure turns every FIFA match into a live financial asset for bookmakers globally.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [11]
>>
