/P 177 0 R
/E (For instance, the English Premier League agreed to voluntarily ban front-of-shirt gambling sponsorships beginning in the 2026/27 season, while countries like Spain, Italy, and the Netherlands have enacted strict laws limiting gambling advertising during sports broadcasts. This dynamic creates an ideological and operational clash between FIFA's global commercial agenda and domestic regulatory frameworks.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
